; lake_glacier.room - Geleira: east of the Frost Guardian's arena, a freezable pool 34 cells wide (cols 3-36, rows 9-10)
; between two stone lips at floor level (WORLD-35, design 04 section 3.5). Wider than any jump (the air jump clears about
; 15 cells), so only Congelar, played from the west lip, crosses it; the ice top is 8 px under the far lip, so Ivo hops
; off. Over the middle of the pool a one-way ledge (cols 19-20, top row 6) holds the letter (`$`): one jump from the ice
; reaches it (104 px over the ice), and it is 16 cells (512 px) from either lip and 96 px up, past a double jump from a
; lip (the kit check finds no kit without Congelar there). It is one-way, so a wall climber falling past finds no face
; to grip; the ceiling (rows 0-1) is flat for the same reason. East, rows 5-8, into lake_icefall.

